      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The alumina scale produced on the Al-modified bond coat will be thin and continuous.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The alumina scale produced on the Al-modified bond coat will be adherent.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Aluminum has a high affinity for oxygen.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10384371::web::027::4_3_oxidation_in_air"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al added to the bond coat will oxidize preferentially at high temperature.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10384371::web::027::4_3_oxidation_in_air",
        "PMC10384371::web::035::4_4_oxidation_thermodynamics"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al2O3 can act as a protective oxide barrier that improves high-temperature oxidation resistance.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10384371::web::027::4_3_oxidation_in_air"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The alumina scale will limit oxygen ingress into the bond coat.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10384371::web::027::4_3_oxidation_in_air"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The alumina scale will reduce thermal stress at the bond-coat/TBC interface.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The 5 at.% Al-modified bond coat will have slower oxide-scale growth than the untreated CrMnFeCoNi bond coat.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10384371::web::027::4_3_oxidation_in_air"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The 5 at.% Al-modified bond coat will reduce thermal-barrier-coating spallation relative to the untreated bond coat.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The 5 at.% Al-modified bond coat will improve TBC durability and reliability relative to the untreated bond coat.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The beneficial effect should remain effective during cyclic oxidation up to approximately 1100 °C.",
      "field": "boundary",
